# Physical PC Setup GUI - System Architecture Diagram

## Workflow Flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant UI as React UI
    participant Store as Zustand Store
    participant IPC as Electron IPC
    participant HW as Hardware Service
    participant Net as Network Service
    participant Infra as Infrastructure Service
    participant Deploy as Deployment Service
    participant Infis as Infisical

    User->>UI: Open Application
    UI->>IPC: Detect Hardware
    IPC->>HW: detectHardware()
    HW->>HW: Collect CPU, RAM, GPU, Network
    HW-->>Store: Update hardwareInfo
    Store-->>UI: Display Hardware Info

    User->>UI: Configure Static IP
    UI->>IPC: Configure Network
    IPC->>Net: configureStaticIP(config)
    Net->>Net: Apply netsh commands
    Net->>Net: Validate connectivity
    Net-->>Infis: Store network config
    Net-->>Store: Update networkConfig
    Store-->>UI: Show success

    User->>UI: Install Docker
    UI->>IPC: Install Docker
    IPC->>Infra: installDocker()
    Infra->>Infra: Download & install
    Infra->>Infra: Validate installation
    Infra-->>Store: Update infrastructure state
    Store-->>UI: Show progress

    User->>UI: Deploy Services
    UI->>IPC: Deploy Service
    IPC->>Deploy: deployGitea()
    Deploy->>Deploy: Pull Docker images
    Deploy->>Deploy: Run containers
    Deploy->>Deploy: Wait for healthy
    Deploy-->>Infis: Store credentials
    Deploy-->>Store: Update services state
    Store-->>UI: Show completion
```

## PC Detection Flow

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> DetectHardware

    DetectHardware --> CollectCPU
    DetectHardware --> CollectRAM
    DetectHardware --> CollectGPU
    DetectHardware --> CollectNetwork

    CollectCPU --> ScorePCType
    CollectRAM --> ScorePCType
    CollectGPU --> ScorePCType
    CollectNetwork --> ScorePCType

    ScorePCType --> Orchestrator: Ryzen 7 6800H<br/>16GB RAM<br/>No GPU
    ScorePCType --> WorkerRTX3060: RTX 3060<br/>32GB RAM
    ScorePCType --> WorkerRTX5090: RTX 5090<br/>32GB RAM
    ScorePCType --> WorkerRTX3090Ti: RTX 3090Ti<br/>32GB RAM

    Orchestrator --> ValidateCompat
    WorkerRTX3060 --> ValidateCompat
    WorkerRTX5090 --> ValidateCompat
    WorkerRTX3090Ti --> ValidateCompat

    ValidateCompat --> StoreInfisical: Compatible
    ValidateCompat --> ManualOverride: Incompatible

    ManualOverride --> StoreInfisical

    StoreInfisical --> [*]
```

