## Service Deployment (Orchestrator)

```mermaid
graph TB
    Start[Start Service Deployment]

    Start --> Gitea[Deploy Gitea]
    Gitea --> |Pull image|GiteaImg[gitea/gitea:latest]
    GiteaImg --> |Run container|GiteaRun[docker-compose up]
    GiteaRun --> |Wait|GiteaHealth{Healthy?}
    GiteaHealth --> |Yes|GiteaCred[Store credentials<br/>in Infisical]
    GiteaHealth --> |No|GiteaRetry[Retry]
    GiteaRetry --> GiteaRun

    GiteaCred --> Postgres[Deploy PostgreSQL]
    Postgres --> |Generate password|PGPass[Random password]
    PGPass --> |Run container|PGRun[docker-compose up]
    PGRun --> |Wait|PGHealth{Healthy?}
    PGHealth --> |Yes|PGCred[Store credentials<br/>in Infisical]
    PGHealth --> |No|PGRetry[Retry]
    PGRetry --> PGRun

    PGCred --> Redis[Deploy Redis]
    Redis --> RedisRun[docker-compose up]
    RedisRun --> |Wait|RedisHealth{Healthy?}
    RedisHealth --> |Yes|RedisCred[Store config<br/>in Infisical]
    RedisHealth --> |No|RedisRetry[Retry]
    RedisRetry --> RedisRun

    RedisCred --> Timescale[Deploy TimescaleDB]
