    TSCred --> Qdrant[Deploy Qdrant]
    Qdrant --> QRun[docker-compose up]
    QRun --> |Wait|QHealth{Healthy?}
    QHealth --> |Yes|QCred[Store config<br/>in Infisical]
    QHealth --> |No|QRetry[Retry]
    QRetry --> QRun

    QCred --> Complete[Deployment Complete]

