## Rollback Strategy

```mermaid
graph LR
    Error[Phase Error Detected]

    Error --> Analyze{Determine<br/>Recovery}

    Analyze --> |Non-critical|Retry[Retry Phase]
    Analyze --> |Reversible|Rollback[Rollback to<br/>Checkpoint]
    Analyze --> |Skip|Skip[Skip Phase]
    Analyze --> |Critical|Abort[Abort Setup]

    Retry --> |Max attempts|Rollback

    Rollback --> RestoreFiles[Restore Files<br/>from Backup]
    RestoreFiles --> RestoreState[Restore State<br/>Snapshot]
    RestoreState --> RevertSystem[Revert System<br/>Changes]

    RevertSystem --> |Network|NetworkRB[Restore DHCP<br/>Reset DNS]
    RevertSystem --> |Services|ServicesRB[Stop Containers<br/>Remove Volumes]
    RevertSystem --> |VPN|VPNRB[Disconnect VPN<br/>Remove Creds]

    NetworkRB --> Validated{Rollback<br/>Validated?}
    ServicesRB --> Validated
    VPNRB --> Validated

    Validated --> |Yes|Success[Rollback Success]
    Validated --> |No|Manual[Manual<br/>Intervention]

    Skip --> Continue[Continue to<br/>Next Phase]

    Abort --> Cleanup[Cleanup<br/>Resources]
    Cleanup --> End[Setup Aborted]

    Success --> Restart[Restart Phase<br/>or Exit]
    Continue --> Restart

    style Error fill:#ffebee
    style Rollback fill:#fff3e0
    style Success fill:#c8e6c9
    style Abort fill:#ffcdd2
```
